        <mxCell id="1aK8AWlVqz4cV3nCHFWr-9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Map out the hardware architecture by creating the block diagrams and circuit schematics required for the prototype&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
