        <mxCell id="1aK8AWlVqz4cV3nCHFWr-11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Assemble the physical ESP32-based monitoring unit along with its integrated sensors and actuators, followed by initial hardware and sensor testing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="220" x="280" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1aK8AWlVqz4cV3nCHFWr-12" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Finalise all technical project reports and documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;. Prepare the defense presentation slides and rehearse the physical prototype demonstration for evaluators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="280" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1aK8AWlVqz4cV3nCHFWr-13" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Write the C++ firmware for the microcontroller and implement the sensor fusion logic to ensure the system can accurately read data and distinguish between actual hazards and false alarms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="220" x="280" y="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1aK8AWlVqz4cV3nCHFWr-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Execute full end-to-end integration testing by simulating specific hazard states, such as gas releases or heat sources, to measure the system&#39;s response time and validate sensor accuracy. This phase also includes testing the LoRa radio fallback by deliberately disabling the primary Wi-Fi connection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="280" y="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1aK8AWlVqz4cV3nCHFWr-15" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Deploy the cloud backend, which includes setting up a virtual machine, MQTT broker, Node-RED middleware, and database&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;. Simultaneously, develop the web dashboard for remote monitoring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
